Crucible PHP

Copyright (c) 2026 Luciano Federico Pereira

Crucible is an independent, clean-room implementation of a test framework
whose observable behavior targets drop-in compatibility with PHPUnit
suites. It contains no code derived from PHPUnit or any other project.
"PHPUnit" is referenced solely as a compatibility statement (nominative
use); no affiliation with or endorsement by the PHPUnit project or its
authors is implied.

